# Symbol packages are large and downloaded by the AL extension
**/.alpackages/
**/.snapshots/
**/rad.json
# No global *.g.xlf rule: appsource/ ships its translation files on purpose.
# Tracks that shouldn't (ui-onboarding) exclude them in their own .gitignore.
# Compiled .app files in each track folder ARE tracked on purpose (overrides a global *.app ignore)
!*.app
